@startuml
!theme plain
title Head of Department Lecturer Assignment
actor "Head of Department" as HOD
participant "Unified Web Shell" as Web
participant "Assignment API" as API
participant "Authorization Service" as Authz
database PostgreSQL as DB

HOD -> Web: Enter lecturer, module offering, workload and start date
Web -> API: POST /academic-assignments/lecturers
API -> Authz: require academic.assign_lecturer for module offering
Authz -> DB: Resolve offering organisational unit
Authz -> DB: Verify HOD active role scope includes unit
DB --> Authz: permitted
API -> DB: Verify lecturer active membership and offering
API -> DB: Lock current active assignment(s)
API -> DB: End or time-bound superseded assignment(s)
API -> DB: Insert new assignment (append-only history)
API -> DB: Insert audit and outbox events
API --> Web: New assignment
Web --> HOD: Confirmation in same work area
@enduml
